<DocsLayout
  title="Changelog — PgDesigner Release History"
  description="PgDesigner release history: new features, improvements, and bug fixes for each version.">

<h2 id="v0.1.0">v0.1.0 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-11-05</span></h2>

<h3>License</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>PgDesigner is now open source</strong> — the license changed from PolyForm Noncommercial to <a href="https://github.com/vmkteam/pgdesigner/blob/master/LICENSE">Apache-2.0</a>, for all earlier releases too. Free for any use, including commercial (<a href="/blog/pgdesigner-is-now-open-source">announcement</a>)</li>
  <li>The registration prompt and the "[unregistered]" title suffix are removed</li>
  <li>The About dialog links to <a href="/pricing#support">support plans</a></li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.6">v0.0.6 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-11-02</span></h2>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>CLI flags work after file names (<code>generate schema.pgd -o out.sql</code>); a 12-character path no longer panics (#17)</li>
  <li><code>convert "postgres://…"</code> writes <code>&lt;dbname&gt;.pgd</code> and never overwrites an existing file; <code>-schema</code> and <code>-full</code> select what to read; DSN passwords are hidden in all messages</li>
  <li>Table <code>WITH (...)</code> including <code>toast.*</code>, <code>UNLOGGED</code>, <code>USING</code> and <code>TABLESPACE</code> are generated and diffed, for partitions too (#19)</li>
  <li>Generated columns survive import from SQL and databases, including PG18 virtual columns; diff switches between plain, stored and virtual</li>
  <li>Index expressions keep <code>opclass</code>, order and nulls; columns and expressions keep their order in the key and are editable in the index editor</li>
  <li>Diff keeps FKs and comments of new tables, enum value changes and index changes, drops tables in FK order, renames indexes and constraints instead of re-creating them, and creates schemas first</li>
  <li>Diff of a live database against its model ignores expression formatting, PK/identity NOT NULL and FK action case</li>
  <li>The table editor keeps <code>NULLS NOT DISTINCT</code>; <code>lint -fix</code> no longer deletes such an index as a duplicate</li>
</ul>

<h3>New Lint Rules</h3>
<ul>
  <li>E033 — generated column without an expression</li>
  <li>W023 — several keys in one index expression</li>
  <li>W024 — type from a non-public schema written without the schema</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.5">v0.0.5 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-06-15</span></h2>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Opening a <code>.sql</code> exported through PgDesigner no longer fails: a literal cast in a partial-index <code>WHERE</code> swallowed the following <code>AND</code></li>
  <li>Inline <code>CREATE TABLE ... PARTITION OF</code> is parsed back as a partition instead of <code>INHERITS</code></li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.4">v0.0.4 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-05-19</span></h2>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li><code>diff -o file.sql</code> writes the migration to a file</li>
  <li><code>INCLUDE</code>, <code>NULLS NOT DISTINCT</code> and <code>TABLESPACE</code> on indexes are generated, parsed from SQL and read from databases</li>
  <li>PDD <code>OnDelete</code>/<code>OnUpdate</code> codes mapped correctly — re-import <code>.pgd</code> files that came from <code>.pdd</code></li>
  <li>New tables follow the project's naming convention for the PK column</li>
  <li>macOS binaries no longer get killed when opening <code>.sql</code></li>
  <li>Adding a single FK no longer reorders unrelated indexes in the saved <code>.pgd</code></li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.3">v0.0.3 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-04-07</span></h2>

<h3>New Features</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>macOS Code Signing</strong> — binaries are signed and notarized, no Gatekeeper warnings</li>
  <li>New <code>camelCase</code> naming lint rule</li>
</ul>

<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Reverse engineering: enums, exclude constraints, index <code>WITH</code> and sort order, <code>NULLS NOT DISTINCT</code></li>
  <li>PDD import: enum types, unicode names, identity columns, defaults; backing indexes are skipped</li>
  <li>SQL import: exclude constraints, <code>NULLS NOT DISTINCT</code>, index <code>WITH</code> parameters, types</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.2">v0.0.2 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-03-27</span></h2>

<h3>New Features</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>File Browser</strong> — visual Open/Save dialogs with directory navigation</li>
  <li><strong>DSN Introspection</strong> — connect to PostgreSQL, preview schemas/tables, selectively import</li>
  <li><strong>Update Checker</strong> — status bar badge when new version available</li>
  <li><strong>Auto-save DDL</strong> — optionally generate .sql file alongside .pgd on every save</li>
  <li><strong>Save SQL</strong> — export DDL, diff patches, and test data as .sql files</li>
  <li><strong>Project Settings</strong> — PG version, naming conventions, FK defaults, lint config</li>
  <li><strong>Canvas Hotkeys</strong> — T (Create Table), F (Create FK), M (Create M:N)</li>
  <li><strong>Keyboard Shortcuts</strong> — Ctrl+N/O/S/Shift+S/W, full keyboard reference (?)</li>
  <li><strong>Column Index Indicator</strong> — Ix column in grid, index links in column properties</li>
  <li><strong>Recent Files</strong> — welcome screen shows 2 most recent files with metadata</li>
</ul>

<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Flat SVG toolbar icons replacing emoji</li>
  <li>FK referenced column is now a dropdown</li>
  <li>Welcome screen shows version in footer</li>
  <li>Save As / Open default to project directory or working directory</li>
  <li>VueUse adoption: useEventListener, useClipboard, useDark, useTitle</li>
  <li>Vue 3.5 best practices: useTemplateRef, shallowRef, onCleanup in watchers</li>
</ul>

<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Fix multi-schema FK lint false positive (E009)</li>
  <li>Fix multi-schema layout position corruption (W014)</li>
  <li>Fix multi-schema GoTo navigation</li>
  <li>Fix duplicate table creation allowed</li>
  <li>Fix node position jumps after FK creation</li>
  <li>Fix fitView over-zooming to 200% on small schemas</li>
  <li>Fix Ctrl+Shift+S intercepted by Ctrl+S</li>
  <li>Fix Ctrl+Shift+D dark mode toggle across keyboard layouts</li>
  <li>Fix identity validation error not highlighting specific columns</li>
  <li>Fix Ctrl+S on new project showing fatal error instead of toast</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h2 id="v0.0.1">v0.0.1 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-muted">— 2026-03-24</span></h2>

<p>Initial release. <a href="/blog/introducing-pgdesigner">Read the announcement →</a></p>

<ul>
  <li>Visual ERD canvas with auto-layout and minimap</li>
  <li>Production-ready DDL generation (15-phase topological sort)</li>
  <li>Diff & ALTER engine with 6 hazard codes</li>
  <li>66 lint rules with one-click autofix</li>
  <li>Sample data generator with FK-aware ordering</li>
  <li>Import from .pdd, .dbs, .dm2, SQL, and live PostgreSQL</li>
  <li>CLI: lint, diff, generate, testdata, convert</li>
  <li>Git-friendly .pgd XML format</li>
</ul>

